<section class="section" id="features"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-kicker">Everything in one place</div><h2>All the tools your tour operation needs.</h2><p>From the first registration to the final ticket, GoTM connects the workflow your team already manages every day.</p></div><div class="features">
<article class="feature"><div class="icon">◈</div><h3>Tour & organization management</h3><p>Create organizations and tours with clean tenant and tour isolation. Manage managers, admins and staff with role-based access.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">◉</div><h3>Public booking pages</h3><p>Give every tour a shareable public page where passengers can register, log in and manage their booking.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">▦</div><h3>Passenger management</h3><p>Create new passengers or reuse organization profiles from previous tours — without carrying old booking state.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">⌂</div><h3>Bus & seat management</h3><p>Set up buses, visual seat plans and secure seat selection. Keep availability accurate while your team operates.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">□</div><h3>Room management</h3><p>Create rooms, capacity and allocations. Let passengers choose available rooms through the booking portal.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">৳</div><h3>Payments & payment requests</h3><p>Track fees, discounts, feature charges, payment intents, received payments, balances and payment status.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">✓</div><h3>Automatic tickets & QR</h3><p>Issue branded digital tickets automatically after full payment with secure QR verification.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">✦</div><h3>Tour features</h3><p>Enable food, T-shirt size, train ticket, launch ticket and future custom features per tour.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">◫</div><h3>Team & permissions</h3><p>Manage organization members and assign tour-level roles so every person sees and controls only what they need.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">▤</div><h3>Reports & operations</h3><p>See passengers, revenue, expenses, balances and tour activity from a centralized operational dashboard.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">◎</div><h3>Customer self-service</h3><p>Passengers can select seats, rooms, extras, make payment requests and access their tickets without calling your team.</p></article><article class="feature"><div class="icon">⚿</div><h3>Security & audit</h3><p>Tenant isolation, CSRF protection, rate limiting, audit logs, secure sessions and payment idempotency built into the platform.</p></article>
