<section class="section alt" id="how"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div class="section-kicker">Simple workflow</div><h2>From tour idea to ticket in a few steps.</h2><p>GoTM keeps your operations connected from setup through departure.</p></div><div class="workflow"><div class="step"><div class="num">01 — CREATE</div><h3>Create your tour</h3><p>Set dates, fee, public page, buses, rooms and the features your tour needs.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="num">02 — PUBLISH</div><h3>Share the booking link</h3><p>Publish a beautiful tour page and let passengers register from any device.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="num">03 — MANAGE</div><h3>Run the operation</h3><p>Manage passengers, seats, rooms, payments, team members and tour activity in one dashboard.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="num">04 — ISSUE</div><h3>Deliver tickets</h3><p>Once a passenger is fully paid, GoTM can issue the secure digital ticket and QR.</p></div></div></div></section>
